      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Provisional junior councillor (gon-shōsanji) — the rank label, set in small type at the head of the block and, by this fascicle's convention, standing to the RIGHT of the three name columns it governs. The block belongs to Sanuki Domain (佐貫藩, Kazusa): it lies to the right of the ○櫻井藩 marker and continues, at the same vertical band, the Kōgo-year (1870) officials list that fills the lower register of the facing leaf."
